' grafica SCREEN 5: PSET, PRESET, POINT, LINE (hardware e ritagliata), box, circle
COLOR 15, 1
SCREEN 5
CLS
PSET (10, 20), 7
PSET (11, 20), 3
PRESET (10, 20)
LINE (0, 0)-(100, 0), 5
LINE (0, 2)-(10, 12), 6, B
LINE (20, 2)-(30, 12), 9, BF
CIRCLE (128, 100), 20, 10
PSET (300, 5), 2
x = POINT(11, 20)
IF x = 3 THEN PSET (5, 50), 12
IF POINT(300, 5) = -1 THEN PSET (6, 50), 12
PSET (100, 100), 8
LINE -(250, 200), 13
LINE (-20, 60)-(40, 60), 14
LINE (10, 200)-(10, 230), 15
LINE (50, 50)-(60, 40), 4
LINE (70, 40)-(60, 50), 4
CIRCLE (5, 5), 10, 2
